# Module Boundaries (Prototype Phase)

## Backend
- `backend/core/voice/`: Audio capture, VAD, STT, and TTS logic.
- `backend/core/llm/`: Interaction with AI models.
- `backend/main.py`: Entry point stitching components together.

## Frontend
- `frontend/src/client/`: Headless logic (WebSocket, AudioContext). NO React components here.
- `frontend/src/store/`: Global State (Zustand).
- `frontend/src/components/`: UI layer only. Should not contain business logic.

Avoid complex abstractions. Prefer simple, direct function calls for this phase.
